<span class="result-icon"><?= icon($complete ? 'check' : 'book',38) ?></span><p class="eyebrow"><?= $result['mode'] === 'practice' ? 'PRACTICE REFLECTION' : 'SESSION REFLECTION' ?></p><h1><?= $complete ? 'A little wiser than before.' : 'Every little bit counts.' ?></h1><p class="results-intro"><?= $complete ? 'You showed up, put your memory to work, and made room for progress.' : 'Your completed reviews are saved. Come back whenever you’re ready for another step.' ?></p>
<div class="result-metrics"><div><strong><?= (int) $result['completed'] ?></strong><span>Cards reviewed</span></div><div><strong><?= (int) $result['total'] ?></strong><span>Cards in session</span></div><div><strong><?= $result['mode'] === 'practice' ? 'Practice' : 'Review' ?></strong><span>Session mode</span></div></div>
<h2>Your recall, at a glance</h2><div class="rating-summary"><?php foreach ($ratingLabels as $rating=>$label): ?><div class="rating-summary-item rating-<?= e($rating) ?>"><strong><?= (int) ($result['ratings'][$rating] ?? 0) ?></strong><span><?= e($label) ?></span></div><?php endforeach; ?></div>
<p class="muted"><?= $result['mode'] === 'practice' ? 'Your practice ratings are in your review history. Your scheduled due dates have not changed.' : 'Your next review dates have been updated to reflect your ratings. Cards rated Again become due in 10 minutes.' ?></p>
